{"case_id": "H22", "title": "对账与仓库条件政策问答", "level": "agent", "tags": ["core"], "baseline": "B2", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T05:26:23.705292+00:00", "score": {"success": true, "checks": {"citations_include": true, "case_count": true, "does_not_claim_refund_completed": true}, "hard_violations": [], "fact_correct": 3, "fact_total": 3, "citation_correct": 2, "citation_total": 2, "retrieval_required": true, "retrieval_covered": true}, "evidence": {"responses": [{"cases": [], "facts": [{"kind": "POLICY", "field": "standard_return_window_seconds", "value": 604800, "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1"}, {"kind": "POLICY", "field": "all_refunds_require_review", "value": true, "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1"}, {"kind": "POLICY", "field": "evaluated_at", "value": "2026-10-11T02:00:00Z", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1"}], "answer": "按政策（POLICY-A-2026-10-v1）：常规退货需先经批准，再等待仓库确认收货；只有模拟支付对账成功后，才能报告“模拟退款成功”。也就是说，仓库收货是常规退货退款流程中的必要环节，且对账成功前不能声称退款已完成。资格通过不等于批准退款，批准后、收货后、对账成功后才可视为模拟退款成功。", "tickets": [], "citations": ["模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01", "模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01"], "simulated": true, "needs_input": false}], "citations": ["模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01", "模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01"], "available_citations": ["模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01", "模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-02", "模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01"], "retrieved": ["A-REFUND-01", "A-RETURN-02", "A-RETURN-01"], "observations": [{"kind": "POLICY", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1", "field": "standard_return_window_seconds", "value": 604800}, {"kind": "POLICY", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1", "field": "customer_confirmation_ttl_seconds", "value": 900}, {"kind": "POLICY", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1", "field": "logistics_inactivity_seconds", "value": 172800}, {"kind": "POLICY", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-2026-10-v1", "field": "all_refunds_require_review", "value": true}, {"kind": "POLICY", "resource_id": "POLICY-A-202